{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣女團i-dle的台灣成員葉舒華前日以演員身份在家鄉出席《第63屆金馬獎》，她與男星林柏宏擔任頒獎嘉賓，因獲得熱情掌聲而激動哽咽。</p><p>而葉舒華昨日在社交網發文寫道：「CUBE啊…我好傷心…」疑似因所屬的CUBE事務所遲遲未有更新她出席《金</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:23:54.294440+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:02:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:17:14.113527+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:17:14.113527+00:00","content_hash":"4516fdef204fab2d0ed7287c025b6387df76041560dc1e4e3920031eba70ab05","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}